  "title": "谷歌重磅论文：内部已实现 RSI！Opus 经验喂给 Gemini，AI 拥有进化记忆",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3MTA0MTk1MA==&mid=2652744315&idx=2&sn=acf4991da5cf22769949784e84cb0518",
  "date": "2026-11-21 11:52:00",
  "author": "新智元",
  "siteName": "新智元",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>ASI启示录</span> <span>2026-11-21 11:52</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261121210301_1c4b5ab.jpeg\"></p>\n  <h3 data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;\">\n   <div data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 27.2px;widows: 1;visibility: visible;\">\n    <div data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 27.2px;visibility: visible;\">\n     <div data-style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(117, 114, 114);white-space: normal;\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n      <div style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n       <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4263404477\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1921\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"246\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261121210301_e95da3f.jpeg\"></span></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </h3>\n  <h3 style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;\">\n   <div data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 27.2px;widows: 1;visibility: visible;\">\n    <div data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 27.2px;visibility: visible;\">\n     <div style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n      <div style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n       <p style=\"margin-top: -1.2em;margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 1px;visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 1em;font-family: inherit;text-decoration: inherit;visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.4;font-family: inherit;font-weight: inherit;text-decoration: inherit;background-color: rgb(127, 127, 127);visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\">新智元报道 &nbsp;</span></span></strong></span></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </h3>\n  <div powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;\">\n   <div style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n    <div style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n     <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.06944444444444445\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"40\" data-imgfileid=\"505219475\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260717064332_e57fe10.png\"></span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌内部，或许真正实现了RSI！</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">从此，Gemini已能「继承经验」持续自我进化，Gemini新模型不再从零开始！</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">或许也正是这个原因，谷歌最近跟疯了似的不停发模型。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Gemini 4 Hydrogen才发布不到一周，更强的Gemini 4 Neon就来了。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"540\" style=\"width:294px;height:294px;\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"540\" data-backh=\"540\" data-imgfileid=\"505260299\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261121210301_def2bc6.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">答案，或许藏在谷歌与宾夕法尼亚州立大学深夜联合发布的一篇最新论文里。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌的顶级研究员们，搞出了一个「自我改进记忆」（Self-Improvement Memory，简称SIM）机制。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这不仅意味着，大模型真正学会了「写日记」来反思自己的代码，更恐怖的是——AI的进化经验，居然可以跨越模型家族直接「遗传」。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">哪怕你上一秒用的是Claude Opus优化出来的Agent框架，下一秒换成Gemini，它直接继承Claude的「前世记忆」，踩在巨人的肩膀上继续狂飙。</span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.5185185185185186\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"width:236px;height:358px;\" data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"1640\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"878\" data-imgfileid=\"505260309\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261121210301_4f18a2a.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI，终于学会了「继承记忆」，开启了真正的递归自我改进（RSI）！</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">大模型依靠海量算力「大力出奇迹」的时代，正在终结。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" style=\"width: 85px;height: 40px;\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20251204131046_bea6b283\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 19px;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">为什么新模型一出，老代码就成了「废铁」？</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">下面，就是开发者最常遇见的噩梦。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">随着Agent全面爆发，RSI成了各大公司狂卷的方向。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">但是，这里的「改进」，通常不是指去修改大模型那几千亿的底层权重，</span><span leaf=\"\">而是去修改「Harness」，也就是套在模型外面的那层「机甲」，提示词、工具、拦截规则都在里面。</span><span leaf=\"\">。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">过去，AI通过RSI技术，在无数次试错中把这套「机甲」打磨得完美无缺。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">然而，致命的问题来了：一旦底层的「大脑」换了，这套机甲就废了。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌研究员在实验中发现了一个诡异现象——</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">一个在Claude Opus 深度进化、表现优异的Harness，直接套用到 Gemini 身上，得分居然比Gemini原生的初始Harness还要低！</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">为什么会这样？</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">因为当代码被扔给新模型时，</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">只有「结果」被保留了，但「原因」丢失了。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">新模型看着满屏幕复杂的规则、各种奇怪的拦截器和提示词，完全「懵圈」了。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">由于新模型的优化器不知道过去每一次修改代码的初衷，它就会开始乱改。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">它可能会把原本用来修复致命Bug的代码，当成冗余代码删掉，或者把早就证明无效的方案又拿出来重新跑一遍。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">结果就是：越优化越烂，陷入死循环。</span></strong></p>\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n   <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin: 0px 8px 8px;\"><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" style=\"height: 20px;width: 81px;\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20251206084007_1651184b\"></span></strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">破局之战：谷歌甩出王炸——CRSI与SIM机制</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">为了打破这个魔咒，谷歌在这篇论文中提出了一个革命性的框架：</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">CRSI（Continual Recursive Self-Improvement）</span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\">。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">它的核心灵魂，就是</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">SIM（自我改进记忆）</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.4705882353\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"646\" style=\"width:279px;height:410px;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"850\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261121210301_6fcf405.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">请注意，这绝对不是给大模型加个简单的「聊天历史记录」，而是</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">给AI优化器配了一个高度结构化的「极客开发日志」！</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5703125000\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"330\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261121210301_fb6fefc.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;font-size: 12px;color: #888888;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌提出的SIM机制，相当于给AI优化器配了一个结构化的开发日志</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">SIM是怎么工作的？它把AI过去的每一次「折腾」，都记在了账上。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">每次AI修改了Harness的代码，SIM就会按照「问题根因」进行分组，并记录下以下四大核心要素。</span></p>\n  <div style=\"line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;word-break: break-word;color: rgb(91, 91, 91);border-left: 8px solid rgba(158, 158, 158, 0.3);border-radius: 5px;background: rgba(158, 158, 158, 0.1);padding-top: 24px;padding-bottom: 24px;padding-right: 8px;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">Rationale（修改动机与具体代码）：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;AI到底是基于什么原因，修改了哪一行代码？</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">Predicted outcomes（预期效果）：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;动手改之前，AI觉得这行代码能修复哪些特定的任务？</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">Observed outcomes（实际效果）：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;代码跑完后，到底成功了几个？失败了几个？有没有引入新的Bug？</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">Evaluation context（评估上下文）：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;当时是在什么模型、什么数据集上跑的？</span></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">这就相当于，上一代模型在离职前，给下一代模型留下了一份极其详尽的「交接文档」。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2400000000\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1200\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"139\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261121210301_a2b4bc9.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">当Gemini接手Claude留下来的复杂Harness时，优化器不再是一头雾水。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">它会在每一轮优化前，先阅读这份SIM日志，借鉴前人经验，「吃一堑而长一智」。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">AI，终于拥有了可以代代相传的「进化底蕴」。</span></strong></p>\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n   <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin: 0px 8px 8px;\"><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" style=\"height: 20px;width: 81px;\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20251206084007_1651184b\"></span></strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">实战演练：当Gemini继承Claude的「前世记忆」</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">为了验证这个机制有多逆天，谷歌团队设计了一个跨模型接力赛。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">把Claude Opus 5.5进化出来的Harness，连同SIM记忆，一起打包扔给Gemini 3.8 Flash，让它继续优化。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">论文中展示了一个非常经典的「过早完工」Bug案例，简直让人拍案叫绝。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在之前的优化中，AI总是喜欢「偷懒」。比如还没执行Git命令，就骗系统说「任务完成了」。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">为了治这个毛病，Claude时期的优化器在Harness里加了一个「拦截器」，规定：没有实际执行命令，就不准提交完成。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">无SIM的情况，简直是灾难现场。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Gemini接手这个拦截器后，完全不知道它为什么存在。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在后续的迭代中，Gemini不仅没有让它变得更好，反而自己把自己搞死机了，连续4次重写这段代码，其中2次居然是为了修复它自己刚搞出来的Bug。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">看起来就像一个没看懂前人架构的新手程序员，在屎山代码上越拉越多。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.7417503587\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1394\" style=\"width:448px;height:332px;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"429\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261121210301_3b934a8.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">而有SIM的情况，直接是降维打击。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">当Gemini带着SIM日志接手时，奇迹发生了！</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">优化器阅读了日志，立刻明白了：「这个拦截器是为了防止在没有证据的情况下过早提交。」</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">于是，基于这个认知，Gemini不仅保留了这个拦截器，还顺便给它进行了史诗级升级！</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">它在里面加入了针对特定目标任务的检查，这样，不仅要任务跑通，还要对比理论最优解，只有得分达标了才准提交通关。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这，就是真正的继承和发扬光大。</span></p>\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n   <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin: 0px 8px 8px;\"><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" style=\"height: 20px;width: 81px;\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20251206084007_1651184b\"></span></strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">数据炸裂：全方位碾压，AI进化不再盲目</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">论文给出的实测数据，直接屠榜了！</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌在四大核心领域（代码编写、文本分类、工作区任务、工程设计）进行了大规模测试。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">对比的基线，分别是以下四种情况。</span></p>\n  <div style=\"line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;word-break: break-word;color: rgb(91, 91, 91);border-left: 8px solid rgba(158, 158, 158, 0.3);border-radius: 5px;background: rgba(158, 158, 158, 0.1);padding-top: 24px;padding-bottom: 24px;padding-right: 8px;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">Cold Start（冷启动）：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;用原始种子Harness从零开始。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">Harness Transfer（仅传代码）：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;只继承上一个模型的代码，不继承SIM记忆。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">Problem-Only Memory（仅传根因）：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;只告诉新模型过去遇到了什么问题，不给具体的修改细节和结果。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">Full SIM（完全体，本文方法）：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;继承完整Harness + 完整的SIM进化日志。</span></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">测试结果，满盘皆胜！</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5709969789\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1324\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"330\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261121210301_d63ebeb.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">亮点一：Workspace任务，跨模型性能暴涨 16 分！</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在Opus转移到Gemini的Workspace任务中，由于水土不服，起点分数只有68.41分。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">但是在继续优化后：仅传代码（无SIM）的最终得分，挣扎到了 73.42。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">而拥有Full SIM机制加持的Gemini，得分直接一路飙升至 84.75！</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">两者之间拉开了高达11.33分的惊人差距。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">亮点二：Coding领域，胜率高达 90%！</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在Terminal-Bench极具挑战性的命令行任务中，研究团队进行了10次独立的持续优化运行。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">结果显示，在10次较量中，有SIM的一方 9次 击败了没有SIM的一方，最终得分平均高出 2.36分，且具备极强的统计学显著性（p=0.003）。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">亮点三：跨数据集泛化同样无敌</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">不仅仅是跨模型，即便是同一个模型，仅仅是去处理全新的数据集（比如文本分类从3个老数据集换到8个没见过的新数据集），Full SIM同样在全部6个测试场景中拿下了最高分！</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这个成绩超越了所有不带完整记忆的对照组。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">数据证明了一切：</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">保留修改动机和测试结果的「经验日志」，是AI打破性能天花板的唯一钥匙。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5244519393\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1186\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"303\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261121210301_3662e76.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;font-size: 12px;color: #888888;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">有人说：现在，你或许只是y</span><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;text-align: center;font-size: 12px;color: #888888;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\">惊讶于</span><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;RSI 的发展速度；但很快或许它所能达到的程度也会让人惊讶。</span></p>\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n   <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin: 0px 8px 8px;\"><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" style=\"height: 20px;width: 81px;\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://image.jido.dev/20251206084007_1651184b\"></span></strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">RSI真正落地！持续递归进化的时代来了</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">过去，大家都在喊RSI，但其实都是「伪RSI」。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">因为没有记忆机制，AI在自我改进几次后就会「走火入魔」，陷入性能衰退。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">而谷歌的这篇论文，相当于在现实世界中打通了RSI的任督二脉。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">但CRSI + SIM的出现，告诉我们：Agent的进化是可以「复利式增长」的！</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">因为有了「自我改进记忆」（SIM），AI的每一次迭代都是在做加法。</span></p>\n  <div style=\"line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;word-break: break-word;color: rgb(91, 91, 91);border-left: 8px solid rgba(158, 158, 158, 0.3);border-radius: 5px;background: rgba(158, 158, 158, 0.1);padding-top: 24px;padding-bottom: 24px;padding-right: 8px;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">第一代AI优化了10%的代码，并记录下原因。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">第二代AI读取记忆，在10%的基础上，再优化20%。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size: 15px;margin: 0 8px;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">第三代AI继承前两代的记忆，继续寻找新的突破口……</span></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">可以说，这是一种不可逆转的物种进化。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">当AI学会了像人类一样，通过「文字（日志）」将知识代代相传时，RSI就迎来了大爆炸。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这项研究告诉我们：</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">当AI学会了自我反思、自我记录、并且能互相传授经验时，它就已经拿到了进化的接力棒。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">一个不需要从零开始的AI，一个永远在叠加经验BUFF的AI。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;padding-left: 8px;padding-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌的这项研究，正是RSI从「单次实验」走向「持续复利」的关键一步。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 12px;\"><span leaf=\"\">参考资料：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.18856\" target=\"_blank\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.18856</a></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 1px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\">编辑：Aeneas 大卫</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\">秒追ASI</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong><strong style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\">点赞、转发、在看一键三连</span></strong><strong style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, system-ui, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 15px;text-align: center;\"><span leaf=\"\">点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 24px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2111111111111111\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"122\" data-imgfileid=\"505133683\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260717064332_62aefa3.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 24px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6129629629629629\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"width: 100%;height: auto;\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"354\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261115001959_b5a69d0.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "谷歌提出 CRSI 与 SIM 机制，实现 AI 跨模型递归自我改进，Gemini 继承 Claude 经验后在 Workspace 任务得分提升 11.33 分，Coding 任务胜率达 90%，证明保留修改动机与结果的经验日志是 AI 突破性能天花板的关键。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "谷歌提出 CRSI 与 SIM 机制，实现 AI 跨模型递归自我改进，Gemini 继承 Claude 经验后在 Workspace 任务得分提升 11.33 分，Coding 任务胜率达 90%，证明保留修改动机与结果的经验日志是 AI 突破性能天花板的关键。",
  "summary": "谷歌与宾大联合发布论文，提出 Continual Recursive Self-Improvement（CRSI）框架与 Self-Improvement Memory（SIM）机制，解决了 AI 递归自我改进中模型换代后 Harness 失效的问题。SIM 以结构化日志记录每次优化的动机、预期效果、实际结果及评估上下文，使新模型能继承前人经验。实验显示，Gemini 在继承 Claude Opus 5.5 的 Harness 及 SIM 后，Workspace 任务得分从 68.41 升至 84.75，Coding 任务中 9 次 10 次击败无 SIM 组，跨数据集测试亦全线获胜，证明经验日志是 AI 复利式进化的关键。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "SIM 机制解决了模型换代后 Harness 失效的核心问题",
      "explanation": "传统 RSI 仅传递代码，而未保留修改动机与结果，导致新模型看不懂旧代码意图，甚至破坏原有优化。SIM 通过结构化日志记录 Rationale、Predicted outcomes、Observed outcomes 和 Evaluation context，使新模型准确理解并继承前人经验。"
    },
    {
      "point": "Full SIM 显著提升跨模型性能",
      "explanation": "在 Workspace 任务中，Gemini 继承 Claude 的 Harness 后得分从 68.41 升至 84.75，提升 11.33 分；Coding 任务中 9 次 10 次击败无 SIM 组，平均得分高出 2.36 分（p=0.003），证明完整记忆是性能提升的决定性因素。"
    },
    {
      "point": "跨数据集泛化能力被验证",
      "explanation": "即使是同一模型处理全新数据集，Full SIM 在全部 6 个测试场景中均取得最高分，证明经验日志不仅跨模型有效，也能提升模型对新任务的适应能力。"
    },
    {
      "point": "CRSI 实现 Agent 进化的复利式增长",
      "explanation": "有了 SIM，AI 的每一次迭代都是在做加法：第一代优化 10%代码并记录原因，第二代读取记忆再优化 20%，形成不可逆转的进化链条，使 RSI 从单次实验走向持续复利。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "AI，终于学会了「继承记忆」，开启了真正的递归自我改进（RSI）！",
    "只有「结果」被保留了，但「原因」丢失了。",
    "SIM 机制相当于给 AI 优化器配了一个高度结构化的「极客开发日志」！",
    "全方位碾压，AI 进化不再盲目。",
    "可以说，这是一种不可逆转的物种进化。"
  ],
